{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_05_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_05","title":"會飲圖","storyCode":"DT-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d510bf6230fafa5f680a62341a643dd3a3f82b0719db9609ddcd63d9f6f9cba0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"誤入畫卷的小隊幾人正在逐漸地迷失自我，與畫融為一體，但萊歐斯卻和原本襲擊他們的墨魎交流起來，甚至關係越來越好。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五、四、三、二、一……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！鐘聲響了，開始吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，左邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，前面！右邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西，後面！左邊！前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！哈呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前後前右左左後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前後左前右左後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼……這附近的墨魎都被處理完了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會！鎮裡人願意收留我們，我們幫忙解決一些麻煩也是應該的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫還要去田裡幫忙種菜，先走一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西這傢伙，已經完全和鎮裡人混熟了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克小哥不也是嘛，張伯剛才還請我叫你解決墨魎就過去喝酒呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那老伯也太不服輸了，喝不過我還硬要挑戰我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐，我今天能去你那裡喝茶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾妹妹有空，我自然是有空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"今天輪到瑪露希爾妹妹講你的冒險故事了，我可是非常期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……我還記得，你們剛到這裡時，說過自己還要去拯救萊歐斯小哥的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"還不出發沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，救法琳是我們的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要找到離開的方法畢竟不能急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在這裡的生活也很好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候再說吧，你說對吧，萊歐斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不聽我說話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵，萊歐斯小哥對墨魎的熱情如今在鎮裡也已經是無人不知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這種叫墨魎的史萊姆真的很有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們有自己固定的形狀，能明顯看出頭身和四肢的區別，攻擊方式不是包裹敵人的頭部，更像是野獸攻擊人的方式，而且還會叫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最特殊的是，我們每次擊殺魔物都會留下屍體，但牠們什麼都不會留下，除了一攤黑色的水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天把牠們的弱點告訴了鎮民們，但是鎮民們卻好像並不是很激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為對這種東西著迷的只有你一個啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是連奇爾查克都學會上手反擊了，這些鎮民卻一直學不會。每次看他們對付墨魎都好像根本不知道怎麼攻擊一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至覺得牠們還能聽得懂人說話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很奇怪，先西也說，牠們不像史萊姆一樣，有明確的器官部位……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？還有漏網之魚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這隻有點眼熟……牠臉上有痣，我好像之前看過……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠前幾天已經被我打死了啊，怎麼又出現了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼情況，難道牠們會復活？……我去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得回來吃飯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，根本沒聽到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，這傢伙就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，瑪露希爾妹妹，你還記得，你們已經來到婆山鎮多久了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來到這裡多久了來著？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等……這也太多了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎們 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡待的時間不短了，每天都殺死了那麼多墨魎，沒想到這裡還有這麼多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多同類聚在一起也沒有產生內部爭鬥……牠們內部是非常和諧的狀態嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎們 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒有看到墨魎寶寶啊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一說，雌雄似乎也看不出來，這裡的都是成年體，沒有年老的，怎麼看都不像一個魔物生活的群落……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？等等，剛剛那隻眼熟的一下子去哪裡了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……糟了，被發現了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得想個辦法，不能讓牠引來更多的墨魎！否則我一個人解決不了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了，牠要叫了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞你一嘴水果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎……唔？吧唧吧唧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"吧唧吧唧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思，還要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你別大聲叫，就可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你，這都是我準備當零食吃的……你安安靜靜地吃，吃了之後跟過來，跟我一起繞到牆後……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好乖啊，怎麼回事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（偷偷爬向牆後）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞄準掉在地上的杏子）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（成功叼到杏子並大快朵頤）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠剛剛還在襲擊小鎮，現在為了幾個水果就變得溫順了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（吃吃吃）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（一口咬住萊歐斯的口袋）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？這是在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去是來攻擊鎮民的，但打贏了看不出開心，打輸了也就跑了，居然會躲在這裡偷吃杏子……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……倒是會因為爭食而打架，但要說是為了食物，山上的果子肯定比鎮裡的多，這麼頻繁地攻擊小鎮，怎麼會只為吃幾個果子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮民沒抓走牠們的幼崽，也不像是侵佔了牠們的領地，牠們究竟哪裡來的敵意……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這不就是剛剛長著痣的那隻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看招！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊歐斯一抬手，一顆杏子飛出，噗的一聲，砸中了眼熟的墨魎的腦袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"牠被砸得差點跌倒，急得想要立起上半身站起來，用兩隻短手捂住腦袋。\n但隨即，牠也聞到了杏子香甜的氣息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還真是來吃杏子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗚！嘎嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吧唧吧唧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我仔細看看……長著痣，頭稍微大一點，尾巴細長但又有分岔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是之前那隻！當時我就覺得你奇怪，肚子吃得那麼鼓，都走不動了，簡直不像來襲擊鎮子的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的復活了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，你們一直在這裡重複著死了又活的生活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，這倒是很像我們在迷宮的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嗚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是奇怪，有這樣的習性，你們去進攻鎮子又是為了什麼呢……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是想吃杏子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我這裡還有最後一點……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
